{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18205210","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18205210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1820521001:0":{"text":"세인은 조금도 망설이지 않고 다시 검을 뽑아 레인을 향해 휘둘렀다","source_cn":"瑟恩毫不犹豫地再次拔剑，挥向里纳","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7FCCFFB4F4E0103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1820521002:0":{"text":"그리고 에스트릴다가 건넨 검을 받아 든 레인은 그대로 세인의 공격을 막아 냈다","source_cn":"里纳接过爱丝特瑞达递来的剑，顺势防御住了瑟恩的攻击","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CBB3C610AAD8209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1820521003:0":{"text":"세인이 아무리 다양한 공격을 퍼부어도 레인은 완벽하게 막고, 피하고, 반격했다","source_cn":"无论瑟恩如何变换攻势，他都能完美地防御、闪避和反击","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x616F9BE063ED9FA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1820521004:0":{"text":"그리고 그런 레인의 공격 역시 모두 세인에게 막혔다...","source_cn":"而他的攻击，也尽数被瑟恩化解……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8B7BF34ADACA5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏文字":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏文字","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}